# Model preference (cost)

- Prefer **Auto** or **Composer** (Standard, not Fast) for almost all work.
- Do **not** switch to Claude / GPT / other API models unless the user asks, or Auto/Composer clearly fails the task.
- Keep responses and tool loops lean to stretch Auto + Composer quota.
- If a harder model is needed, say so briefly and wait for user OK before assuming API spend.
